# Rebuild-under-fire's second arm ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 1):
# the Impossible base with rebuild 15000 -- the larger of the two drop
# scales the strike search measured, holding the walk back until a whole
# wave has visibly died. Everything else is flame-nocover exactly.

